A capture of three played by code, a frame every 50 ms:
  heard at 200 ms: stop 0
  heard at 400 ms: stop 1
  heard at 600 ms: take
The same tapped stop by stop:
  heard at 350 ms: stop 0
  tap 8 at 450 ms: stop 1
  heard at 650 ms: take
A drag dropped on a stop:
  dropped on 33 at 100 ms: stop 0
Wrong squares while a capture is due:
  tap 46 at 0 ms: must
  tap 41 at 200 ms: must
  heard at 2200 ms: stop 0
  tap 50 at 2300 ms: wrong
A quiet move, a man crowned, a puzzle's last move:
  heard at 300 ms: move
  heard at 300 ms: crown
  heard at 300 ms: solved
One sound a move:
  move -> move
  stop 0, take, won -> stop 0, won
  take, crown -> crown
  crown, drawn -> drawn
  move, lost -> lost
  wrong, move, gold -> wrong, move, gold
  must -> must
The clocks:
  side 1: nothing
  side 1, under a minute: gold
  side 1, under a minute: nothing
  side 1: nothing
  side 1, under a minute: nothing
  side 1, under a minute, at 0:20: red
  side 1, under a minute, at 0:20: nothing
  side 0, under a minute, at 0:20: red
  the computer's clock under a minute: nothing
  straight to 0:20: red, then under a minute: nothing
